---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="How to Negotiate Stock Options at a Startup"
  description="Understand vesting schedules, strike prices, ISOs vs NSOs, and how to negotiate more equity in early-stage startups."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", path: "/" },
    { name: "Guides", path: "/guides" },
    {
      name: "How to Negotiate Stock Options at a Startup",
      path: "/guides/how-to-negotiate-startup-stock-options",
    },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full space-y-6 reveal">
    <div id="readingProgress" class="reading-progress"></div>

    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mt-8 mb-4">How to Negotiate Stock Options at a Startup</h1>
      
      <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed my-4">
        Negotiating your compensation package is one of the most critical steps in securing your long-term career growth. According to hiring surveys from NACE and Glassdoor, over <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">85% of employers expect candidate counter-offers</strong>, yet fewer than 1% of offers are ever rescinded over polite, data-backed negotiation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-8 mb-3">Understanding Your Market Value</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed my-4">
        Before entering any negotiation, grounding your request in objective market data ensures your ask is treated as a factual business conversation rather than an emotional demand.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent-blue bg-surface p-4 my-4 rounded-r-lg italic text-sm text-body">
        "Always base your salary counter-offer on regional percentile data and your specific skill alignment—never personal expenses like rent or debt."
      </blockquote>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-8 mb-3">Step-by-Step Execution Strategy</h2>
      <li class="ml-4 list-decimal text-sm text-body my-1"><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Acknowledge & Buy Time:</strong> Express gratitude for the offer and request 24–48 hours to review full package details in writing.</li>
      <li class="ml-4 list-decimal text-sm text-body my-1"><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Benchmark Compensation:</strong> Use tools like <a href="/salary-calculator" class="text-accent-blue hover:underline font-medium">SalaryPitcher's Salary Calculator</a> to evaluate base, tax take-home, and regional medians.</li>
      <li class="ml-4 list-decimal text-sm text-body my-1"><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Craft Your Pitch:</strong> Submit a polite, structured email counter-offer proposing a clear target number backed by performance data.</li>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink mt-8 mb-3">Copy-Paste Counter-Offer Email Script</h2>
      <pre class="bg-surface p-4 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink overflow-x-auto my-4 border border-hairline"><code>Subject: Job Offer Follow-Up - [Your Name]

Dear [Hiring Manager Name],

Thank you so much for extending the offer to join [Company Name] as [Position Title]! I am truly excited about the opportunity to contribute to the team's goals.

After reviewing the details of the offer package alongside market benchmarks for how to negotiate startup stock options in our region, I was hoping we could discuss the base salary component.

Given my track record in [Key Skill/Achievement], I would be delighted to accept immediately if we could bring the base salary to [Target Amount].

Thank you again for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing your thoughts!

Best regards,
[Your Name]</code></pre>
    </article>

    <!-- Tool CTA Footer -->
    <div class="border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 mt-12">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center sm:text-left">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-ink">
          Ready to draft your counter-offer?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-body">
          Use Salary Pitcher's free Pitch Assistant to generate custom, persuasive counter-offer emails in under 2 minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/pitch-assistant"
        class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-ink text-canvas hover:bg-ink/90 font-medium rounded-full text-xs transition-colors shrink-0 ripple-btn btn-press"
      >
        Start Pitch Assistant →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
